{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The available Spotify read responses expose queue membership and playback state but not whether a song is liked, so the requested postcondition cannot be verified after calling spotify.like_song.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public Spotify read response field or endpoint exposing liked status by song_id, such as spotify.show_song_queue.items[].is_liked"],"task_id":"ccb4494_2","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"A compliant executable plan requires a public read API that can verify that every selected song is liked after the mutations.","steps":[]}